<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh trade deficit widens to $247 mln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh trade deficit widens to $247 mln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit widened to $247 million in February from $220 million in January and $130.2 million in February, 1996, central bank officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>	    BANGLADESH'S BALANCE OF TRADE</p>
<p>	     (millions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>			February   January  February 96</p>
<p>    Exports	   356.0     320.0    244.8</p>
<p>    Imports	   603.0     540.0    375.0</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
